			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Standardize shell script indentation and operator spacing\n\nAlign all shell scripts in the Maintain/ directory to the project's strict indentation standards. Replace hard tabs with four-space indentation across all build, debug, release, and profiling scripts (Build.sh, Run.sh, Dev-Mountain.sh, Profile.sh, etc.).\n\nAdditionally, add a required space after all `2>` and `> /dev/null` redirection operators to satisfy shell formatting linters. Refactor multi-line command chains in Format.sh, GenerateRouteManifest.sh, and SmokeProfiles.sh to use explicit backslash continuation and pipe alignment for improved readability.\n\nThese changes ensure consistent formatting across the entire build pipeline tooling, preparing the scripts for automated linting enforcement.",
			"SHA": "a6d77e496b9b728bdd877b24a3d5c8e6fe4566ed"
		},
